# ============================================================
# SGC Command - .gitattributes
# Zero-Dependency / offline-first project:
# all text files are stored as LF in the repo and checked out
# as LF even on Windows (no CRLF churn in multi-model diffs).
# ============================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files - never re-encode
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mod binary
*.sid binary
*.mid binary
*.bin binary